Overlay patch 0020 (reference 0018 parity): touch scrolling for the 2S2H
menu (the shell queues finger deltas via overlay 0015's exports; the menu's
scrollable children — search results, sidebar, both section variants —
consume them when the finger is horizontally inside; mouse-free so no
hover/slider side-effects) + the iOS quit fix (menu quit does CVarSave +
exit(0) after Window->Close(): there is no desktop loop to unwind, Close
alone froze the Ship of Harkinian port on device). __IOS__-only.

